title: Signing in with GitHub shows a code, keeps the sign-in, and sends the settings to a secret gist
folders: rust-small
github: empty
expect-log: script: Account\("menu"\)
forbid-log: Could not

wait 2500
account signin
wait 800
mark a-code
wait 4500
mark b-signed-in
wait 400
account menu
wait 2500
mark c-menu
wait 400
quit
